            "Research **burns money** if you let it. Set a **dollar and step budget** up front, show remaining, stop cleanly, return partial work. Recover: if search is down, use the private index or return partial; if a fetch 404s, try a fallback source; if the model 429s, backoff and spend the remaining budget later. Do not restart from zero and double-spend.",
